      "sc:description": "DoReMiTra is an R/Bioconductor data package that provides a unified collection of curated transcriptomic datasets related to radiation exposure (neutron, x-ray, gamma ray). It facilitates reproducible analysis, visualization, and biomarker discovery in radiation transcriptomics.",
